00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Camera-health monitoring with OpenCV and NumPy.
Synthetic scene + injected faults.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,520
Blur develops at source t = 6.00 s.
The alarm waits for persistent evidence.

3
