Partial obstruction removes local texture.
The actual output highlights the affected tiles.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Frozen frames: the image stops while timestamps advance.
The monitor raises an UNUSABLE event.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Same startup blur, same source timestamps.
A healthy reference detects it; auto-baselining can learn it as normal.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Events and frame metrics are exported as JSON and CSV.
The values shown come from this demo run.

7
